+env AUDIT_LEAN_EXE_PATH=/opt/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.22.0/bin/lean LD_PRELOAD=/tmp/audit-work/libaudit_proc_exe.so lake build
+```
+
+Their complete transcripts are `fresh-lake-clean.log` and
