  ✓ Reconstruct and independently classify the complete verification rule inventory
  ✓ Validate producer provenance, rerun Stage 4 preflight, and audit obligation/target bijections
  ✓ Perform fresh Stage 5 clean build, target/axiom checks, and adversarial operational-bridge audit
  ✓ Write and validate self-contained REVIEW.md with final verdict pair
